1
00:00:00,967 --> 00:00:02,797
(Leonard:)And how could a chimp
even solve that?

2
00:00:02,802 --> 00:00:04,302
(Leonard:)That was impossible.

3
00:00:04,304 --> 00:00:06,734
(Penny:)Really? You couldn't get it out?

4
00:00:10,276 --> 00:00:11,606
(Barry:)Thank you.

5
00:00:11,611 --> 00:00:13,611
AMY: Wow, the
store looks great.

6
00:00:13,613 --> 00:00:15,613
(Leonard:)So you guys were
testing us both?

7
00:00:15,615 --> 00:00:16,645
(Leonard:)What is the
matter with you?

8
00:00:16,649 --> 00:00:18,149
PENNY: Eh, what's
the matter with them is

9
00:00:18,151 --> 00:00:19,821
(Penny:)they think they're so smart
they don't care

10
00:00:19,819 --> 00:00:21,489
(Penny:)if they hurt
other people's feelings.

11
00:00:21,487 --> 00:00:23,217
(Sheldon:)Sounds like us.
That's not true.

12
00:00:25,825 --> 00:00:28,495
(Sheldon:)I still don't understand
why you're upset.

13
00:00:28,494 --> 00:00:31,494
(Sheldon:)You solved every puzzle faster
than all of the chimps.

14
00:00:31,497 --> 00:00:34,227
(Amy:)Well, except Barnabas,
but he was on Adderall.

15
00:00:35,668 --> 00:00:38,168
(Howard:)I'm sorry, but it's
making me crazy.

16
00:00:38,171 --> 00:00:40,501
(Bernadette:)Can you please
just let it go?

17
00:00:40,506 --> 00:00:42,536
(Sheldon:)Oh, I can help
you with that.

18
00:00:43,843 --> 00:00:46,343
(Penny:)Imagine you're holding
an ordinary pen.

19
00:00:48,348 --> 00:00:51,418
While your favorite pen is
safe and secure in your pocket.

20
00:00:52,652 --> 00:00:53,982
(cell phone rings)

21
00:00:53,987 --> 00:00:55,757
(Howard:)Hold that thought.

22
00:00:55,755 --> 00:00:56,755
(Howard:)Hello?

23
00:00:56,756 --> 00:00:59,026
(Amy:)How can I make this up
to you?

